  "claims": [
    {
      "id": "claim_e475003793224e09859fe0e91f986a1e",
      "statement": "Manifold keeps the diffusers-style four-component layout (Model / Scheduler / Module / Pipeline) with manifold-owned base classes — it does not subclass the `diffusers` library — and the Model components wrap rather than reimplement MONAI MAISI backbones (`AutoencoderKL`, `UNet3DConditionModel`, `ControlNet3DConditionModel`, `RewardModel` over `PatchDiscriminator`).",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://CONTEXT.md",
          "version": "repo-file-v1:sha256:699cfc96f28ee81cde3fd8f1af0ccf82dd9c755fbce32ffc41633379f7031864"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/manifold/__init__.py",
          "version": "repo-file-v1:sha256:27e1834aa2e478956fed97aeff717499b56b7769c5bb218e0edb02cf83845de1"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/manifold/models/__init__.py",
          "version": "repo-file-v1:sha256:45a14f7ad56edaca3422febe7743dec50cc5557bd0fe96ab08f24afec0aef2a1"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_94a31be3e0ef4ab2afb65afc51e2271b",
      "statement": "The supervised ControlNet path registers the `paired_fidelity` callback by default (`PairedFidelitySpec` under that registry name, in the spine's default callback-name set), so `manifold-train-controlnet` logs observe-only `val/psnr` / `val/ssim` on every gated validation epoch while the checkpoint monitor stays latent-space `val/x0_mae`.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/manifold/metrics/paired_callback.py",
          "version": "repo-file-v1:sha256:2d78c68acfbf98d12fd04e32a4f389c475e78b3fecb22202dbb21d1882c221e0"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/manifold/training/callbacks/paired_fidelity.py",
          "version": "repo-file-v1:sha256:09c5b8bb0451cd41f6c98d678177eb1d52639198fcd4bd89a0a29b6af1339273"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/manifold/training/controlnet_cli.py#L152-L198",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:6a9fc176c58fa0adc4b448b528b61d811f8445278c564d74335647d56862c434:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_fe626fa609d74a57b35c9c04a0eeba98",
      "statement": "The in-training paired-fidelity monitor and the offline before/after comparison score through the same metric and the same normalization: the monitor rolls the module's own full Heun ControlNet rollout, decodes generated and real target, applies `min_max_to_unit` per sample, and calls `PairedFidelityMetrics`, exactly as `BeforeAfterEval` does, so the in-training curve and the offline number are directly comparable.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/manifold/eval/before_after.py",
          "version": "repo-file-v1:sha256:ff5b7013e86e044b859edc917ce46c246182162a4802fbb05dfdf1f608cfc40f"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/manifold/metrics/paired.py",
          "version": "repo-file-v1:sha256:1a388bde3ad7969aedbd81e1f240df70e48bb327a68f1a08b9b0f83a7078ebd1"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/manifold/metrics/paired_callback.py#L172-L217",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:8a5fe6a011d00b9e64fe6c4b3492118be10ac54fae4796a2389098205a7e61b4:"
        },
        {
