        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_10fb5cfaa9cc4dc493235c56ee7b1325",
      "statement": "The scheduler layer owns the rectified-flow transport, the timestep/sigma grid, model-input scaling, Heun integration, and the stochastic GRPO SDE transition (`FlowMatchGRPOScheduler.sde_step_mean` inherits the transport and Heun steps verbatim); the paired-GRPO Brownian bridge is no longer part of the tree.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://docs/adr/0034-one-realism-reward-both-grpo-policies-delete-condition-aware.md",
          "version": "repo-file-v1:sha256:ab63de45fe9112825e9a55405cef1eada429f422dd3b18d5297df3df7271fb25"
