    },
    {
      "id": "claim_07ea15634b314e5da29f1c92f89eb17c",
      "statement": "`manifold-eval` infers the policy from the before artifact's own `model_index.json` (`pipeline_class`) instead of accepting a mode flag, and it exports the after Lightning `.ckpt` into a native directory through the existing ADR-0006 export bridge before reloading both sides.",
