    },
    {
      "id": "claim_469865fe2d7440f0b0339a7e86287490",
      "statement": "Training-time sampling and native inference share one rollout primitive per policy family — `sample_latent_flow` for JiT and `controlnet_rollout` for ControlNet — so the Module's `sample()` and the Pipeline cannot drift into parallel integrators.",
